  "title": "Common implication errors.",
  "body": "Common implication errors  Remember that The negation of is definitely not  This is a surprisingly common error. Please memorise .  It's also important to remember that:  if the hypothesis of an implication is false, the implication is true, and  if the conclusion of an implication is true, the implication is true.    "
