  "body": " Let be the set of students at UBC, and consider the relation attended highschool with .  Reflexive It is reflexive since every student went to highschool with themselves.  Symmetric It is symmetric, because if student went to highschool with , then went to the same highschool as .  Transitive It is not transitive, just because went to school with and went to school with , it does not mean that went to school with . It is possible that went to two different highschools, one they attended with and the second they attended with .   "
